OL,3,GNEWSAIt was my parents' dream home, now
OL,4,Ait has to be demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has spoken of the
OL,7,F"anguish" of having to move his elderly
OL,8,Fparents from the house they had built
OL,9,Ffor their retirement because of
OL,10,Fdefective concrete blocks.
OL,12,FAli Farren, who was elected to Donegal
OL,13,FCounty Council as a member of the 100%
OL,14,FRedress Party, said his 85-year-old
OL,15,Fmother, who has dementia, and his
OL,16,Ffather have had to move into another
OL,17,Fproperty so their house in Malinhead
OL,18,Fcan be demolished.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
