OL,3,GNEWSAIt was my parents' dream home, now
OL,4,Ait has to be demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of homes in the Republic of
OL,7,FIreland, mostly in counties Donegal,
OL,8,FClare, Limerick, Mayo and Sligo are
OL,9,Faffected by the defective blocks.
OL,11,FMany homes are crumbling due to
OL,12,Fwater-absorbing minerals, like pyrite,
OL,13,Fcausing bricks to crack, which has led
OL,14,Fto some homes needing to be demolished.
